# shadcn instructions

Use the latest version of Shadcn to install new components, like this command to add a button component:

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button
```

# design system instructions

Components MUST consume the design tokens and classes in `src/styles.css` (see
[../DESIGN_SYSTEM.md](../DESIGN_SYSTEM.md)) — never hardcode hex/rgba colors.
After `shadcn add`, swap any `bg-muted`/`bg-accent` surface utilities for
`bg-surface-strong` and give action buttons pill geometry (`rounded-full`);
CTAs use the ink pill only (`bg-primary` / `.btn-primary`). Display type
(`font-display`) is never bolded; money renders with `.money`, not `font-mono`.
